==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From {{term|afmælis|lang=is}} the genitive of {{term|afmæli||birthday|lang=is}} + {{term|dagur||day|lang=is}}. Literally means "day of a birthday" or "birthday day".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈavmaiːlɪsˌd̥aːɣʏr]|lang=is}} (correctly) or {{IPA|[ˈamːaiːlɪsˌd̥aːɣʏr]|lang=is}} (colloquially)

===Noun===
'''afmælisdagur''' {{m}}

# [[birthday]]

